         "Edit hashchange handler in tabs.js: if {profileId} is present in parsed URL and differs from active profile, call window.profileSwitcher.switchTo(profileId) before loading the tab.",
         "Edit src/public/js/core/profile-switcher.js switchTo(): after switching, update window.location.hash to include new profileId: const {main} = getTabInfoFromUrl(); if (PROFILE_SPECIFIC_TABS.includes(main)) { window.location.hash = main + \"/\" + profileId; }",
