       "description": "A single WhatsApp number can flood the bot with hundreds of messages per minute, exhausting AI provider quotas and degrading service for all users. The existing rate limiter operates at a profile level, not per individual user JID. A sliding-window per-JID limiter should throttle abusive senders with a polite rejection message.",
       "acceptanceCriteria": [
