-      "id": "US-924",
-      "title": "WCAG 2.2 SC 2.4.11: Prevent sticky UI from fully obscuring keyboard focus",
-      "priority": "high",
-      "description": "The webchat widget contains a sticky footer (quick-reply bar) and fixed header that can completely hide a focused element when users tab through the interface. SC 2.4.11 (Level AA) requires that when any UI component receives keyboard focus, it is not entirely hidden by author-created content. This is a new WCAG 2.2 requirement not addressed by the existing WCAG 2.1 keyboard accessibility story.",
-      "acceptanceCriteria": [
