-        "CSS scroll-padding or equivalent technique is applied so the viewport scrolls to reveal focused elements beneath fixed UI chrome",
-        "Verified with keyboard-only navigation on at least two screen sizes (mobile 375px and desktop 1280px)",
-        "Automated axe-core or playwright accessibility scan reports zero SC 2.4.11 violations"
-      ],
-      "technicalNotes": [
-        "Sufficient technique: C43 â€” CSS scroll-padding on scrollable container to offset sticky header/footer height",
-        "Test tool: axe-core 4.8+ includes SC 2.4.11 rules; or manual keyboard test",
-        "Applies to: webchat widget's message list, order confirmation form, and any modal dialogs"
