-      "priority": "high",
-      "description": "SC 2.5.8 (Level AA, new in WCAG 2.2) requires that all pointer-activated controls are at least 24x24 CSS pixels, or that undersized targets have sufficient spacing so a 24px diameter circle does not intersect adjacent targets. The webchat widget contains several small controls (close button, reaction icons, quick-reply chips) that likely fall below this threshold on mobile devices.",
