-        "Verified on viewport widths of 320px, 375px, and 414px (common mobile screen widths)",
-        "No regression introduced to desktop layout at 1280px"
-      ],
-      "technicalNotes": [
-        "Inline text links are exempt from this criterion (SC 2.5.8 exception 3)",
-        "User-agent-rendered browser controls are also exempt",
