-      "priority": "high",
-      "description": "SC 3.3.8 Accessible Authentication Minimum (Level AA, new in WCAG 2.2) prohibits authentication processes that require users to memorise or manually transcribe information unless an alternative is provided. The webchat admin login and any widget-side identity verification must permit password manager autofill, copy-paste, and must not block browser autocomplete attributes. One-time code entry must also support paste.",
