-      "priority": "high",
-      "description": "Malaysia PDPA Section 129 restricts transfer of personal data outside Malaysia unless the destination country provides adequate protection. Rainbow AI sends guest messages containing personal data to overseas AI providers (NVIDIA, OpenRouter, Ollama-cloud). The JPDP has confirmed cross-border transfer guidelines are being developed. Businesses must document and justify these transfers with a data transfer impact assessment.",
