-      "title": "WhatsApp Flows: Image Carousel for room and menu visual browsing",
-      "priority": "medium",
-      "description": "Flow JSON v7.1 (June 2025) introduced the Image Carousel component allowing up to 3 images per carousel, 2 carousels per screen, on a 4:3 or 16:9 aspect ratio. This enables rich visual browsing within WhatsApp Flows â€” showing hostel room types with photos during the check-in/booking flow, or displaying menu item images during the AI waiter ordering flow â€” without leaving the WhatsApp interface.",
-      "acceptanceCriteria": [
