-        "Images are base64-encoded PNG or JPEG, each under 100KB to avoid payload bloat",
-        "alt-text is populated from the room/menu item description fields in the admin data",
-        "Flow renders correctly on WhatsApp iOS, Android, and WhatsApp Web (Web support from Dec 2025)",
-        "Fallback text is shown if images fail to load"
-      ],
-      "technicalNotes": [
-        "Component: type: 'ImageCarousel', images array max 3 items, aspect-ratio: '4:3' | '16:9'",
-        "Images require base64 encoding in Flow JSON src field â€” pre-encode at flow publish time",
-        "No on-click-action support â€” carousel is display-only; pair with downstream ChipsSelector for selection",
-        "Maximum 2 carousels per screen, 3 total per flow",
-        "WebP format requires iOS 14.6+ â€” use JPEG/PNG for maximum compatibility"
-      ],
