-      "description": "Meta announced in November 2025 that WhatsApp Flows would begin rendering on WhatsApp Web companions starting early December 2025. Previously, flows only worked on mobile. This change means guests using WhatsApp Web can now complete check-in forms, reservation flows, and order flows â€” but existing flows must be validated for the desktop rendering context, as layout assumptions made for mobile screens may break.",
