-      "description": "Meta banned general-purpose AI chatbots from the WhatsApp Business Platform effective January 15, 2026 (new accounts from October 15, 2025). Rainbow AI must demonstrably operate as a task-specific assistant â€” only handling defined use cases such as bookings, order tracking, support, and notifications â€” and must not present as an open-ended conversational AI. Non-compliant bots risk account termination.",
