-      "priority": "high",
-      "description": "Malaysia's PDPA Amendment Act 2024 introduced a clearer right to erasure ('right to be forgotten'), giving data subjects the right to request deletion of their personal data. Rainbow AI stores guest conversation history, PII in messages, booking data, and analytics â€” all of which must be erasable on verified request within a documented timeline. This is distinct from the existing data portability story.",
