-      "priority": "medium",
-      "description": "The PDPA Amendment Act 2024 Section 43A grants data subjects the right to request their personal data be transmitted in a machine-readable format. The existing portability story covers admin-triggered export; this story requires a user-facing self-service request mechanism accessible via WhatsApp or the webchat widget, with a documented transmission timeline and third-party controller handoff capability.",
