-      "priority": "medium",
-      "description": "OWASP LLM09:2025 (Misinformation) covers LLM hallucinations that produce false but plausible operational facts such as check-in times, room availability, menu prices, or Wi-Fi passwords. Rainbow AI must ground all factual claims in its knowledge base and refuse to answer factual questions outside its verified data rather than hallucinating plausible-sounding responses.",
