-      "description": "Meta deprecated Marketing API v19.0 on February 4, 2025, and v20.0 on May 6, 2025. Graph API v21.0 is now the current stable version. Any Rainbow AI code making calls to v19 or v20 endpoints will receive errors. Beyond the immediate risk, Meta follows a rolling 2-version deprecation schedule, so all API calls must target a version no more than 2 major releases behind the current stable to remain within support.",
