-      "description": "Industry best practice for RAG-based chatbots in 2025 is to surface the source document or section that informed the AI's answer, enabling users to verify information and operators to identify outdated KB content. This is especially relevant for hostel policy answers (check-in times, room rates, cancellation policy) where guests may need to verify the accuracy of the information provided. Source attribution also directly supports OWASP LLM09 (misinformation) and AIGE transparency requirements.",
