-      "priority": "high",
-      "description": "WhatsApp Cloud API webhooks can deliver the same event more than once under network retry conditions. Without deduplication, Rainbow AI may process duplicate messages — sending two AI replies to one user message, charging twice for the same send, or creating duplicate order records. A lightweight deduplication layer using WhatsApp message IDs (wamid) at the webhook entry point prevents these issues.",
