-      "priority": "medium",
-      "description": "Meta introduced a Limited-Time Offer template category that adds a countdown timer to marketing messages, increasing conversion rates for flash sales and expiring promotions. Makan Moments and Pelangi can use LTO templates for happy-hour specials, room flash deals, and event promotions. Rainbow AI's template builder should support creating and sending LTO templates with configurable expiry timestamps.",
-      "acceptanceCriteria": [
