-        "Admin can preview the LTO template with a sample countdown before submitting to Meta for approval",
-        "Expiry timestamp validation: must be a future UTC timestamp at least 1 hour from the send time",
-        "Sent LTO templates are tracked in analytics with an lto_expiry field for conversion window analysis"
