-      "description": "WhatsApp conversational commerce requires an up-to-date product catalog in Meta Commerce Manager to power product cards, catalog browsing, and in-chat shopping. Makan Moments menus and Pelangi room listings should be synchronised from an external source (CSV or REST API) to the WhatsApp Business catalog automatically. This is distinct from the internal menu sync (which updates the AI's knowledge base) — this targets the WhatsApp-native catalog used for product card messages and catalog browsing.",
