-      "description": "WhatsApp Pay is not available in Malaysia. Makan Moments and Pelangi need a Malaysia-compatible in-chat payment experience supporting FPX online banking and local e-wallets (Touch 'n Go, GrabPay). Rainbow AI should generate dynamic payment links from a Malaysian gateway (Billplz or iPay88) and send them via WhatsApp CTA button template after order confirmation. This is distinct from the Stripe hostel booking story (which targets international card payments).",
