-      "description": "WhatsApp message templates often include quick-reply buttons (e.g., 'Confirm Order', 'Cancel', 'See Menu') and CTA buttons. Currently Rainbow AI processes button responses as intents but does not aggregate button click rates. Button analytics helps operators optimise template CTAs, identify drop-off points in conversion funnels, and measure campaign engagement beyond delivery receipts.",
-      "acceptanceCriteria": [
