-        "Admin analytics dashboard shows per-template button click rates (clicks / messages delivered for that template)",
-        "Funnel view shows click sequences for multi-step flows (e.g., confirm order → pay now → receipt acknowledged)",
-        "Button analytics are filterable by date range and template name",
-        "Click data is subject to the configured data retention policy (default: 90 days)"
-      ],
-      "technicalNotes": [
-        "Button reply webhook field: messages[].interactive.button_reply.id and .title",
